req	Level 10 Fishing
step	1	-	Quick guide step 1
line	<col=000080>Speak to either dwarves on either side of the <col=800000>White Wolf Mountain</col>. Note: Starting on the west side makes travelling by foot easier.</col>
step	2	-	Quick guide step 2
line	<str>Speak to either dwarves on either side of the White Wolf Mountain. Note: Starting on the west side makes travelling by foot easier.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>If you need <col=800000>garlic</col>, go to <col=800000>Seers' Village</col> and take it from the house south-west of the bank (it spawns on the table).</col>
step	3	-	Quick guide step 3
line	<str>Speak to either dwarves on either side of the White Wolf Mountain. Note: Starting on the west side makes travelling by foot easier.</str>
line	
line	<str>If you need garlic, go to Seers' Village and take it from the house south-west of the bank (it spawns on the table).</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Bring a <col=800000>spade</col> and make your way to <col=800000>McGrubor's Wood</col> (either enter through the back or teleport to <col=800000>fairy ring</col> ALS if you completed at least half of <col=800000>Fairytale II - Cure a Queen</col>) to gather 3 <col=800000>red vine worm</col>. You can collect them by checking the vine just west of the <col=800000>fairy ring</col> ALS.</col>
step	4	-	Quick guide step 4
line	<str>Speak to either dwarves on either side of the White Wolf Mountain. Note: Starting on the west side makes travelling by foot easier.</str>
line	
line	<str>If you need garlic, go to Seers' Village and take it from the house south-west of the bank (it spawns on the table).</str>
line	
line	<str>Bring a spade and make your way to McGrubor's Wood (either enter through the back or teleport to fairy ring ALS if you completed at least half of Fairytale II - Cure a Queen) to gather 3 red vine worm. You can collect them by checking the vine just west of the fairy ring ALS.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Either walk south to <col=800000>Hemenster</col> or teleport to the <col=800000>Ranging Guild</col> via your <col=800000>combat bracelet</col> and go north-west.</col>
step	5	-	Quick guide step 5
line	<str>Speak to either dwarves on either side of the White Wolf Mountain. Note: Starting on the west side makes travelling by foot easier.</str>
line	
line	<str>If you need garlic, go to Seers' Village and take it from the house south-west of the bank (it spawns on the table).</str>
line	
line	<str>Bring a spade and make your way to McGrubor's Wood (either enter through the back or teleport to fairy ring ALS if you completed at least half of Fairytale II - Cure a Queen) to gather 3 red vine worm. You can collect them by checking the vine just west of the fairy ring ALS.</str>
line	
line	<str>Either walk south to Hemenster or teleport to the Ranging Guild via your combat bracelet and go north-west.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>If you don't have a Fishing Rod, purchase one from <col=800000>Grandpa Jack</col> for 5|c in the house outside <col=800000>Hemenster</col> entrance.</col>
